## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js >= 18.0.0
- npm or pnpm
- Docker (optional, for containerized deployment)

### Installation

```bash
npm install
```

### Development

```bash
# Start development mode with hot reload
npm run dev

# Generate TypeScript from YAML agents
npm run build

# Run type checking
npm run typecheck
```

### Testing

```bash
# Run tests
npm test

# Run tests with coverage
npm run test:coverage

# Run CI tests (used in GitHub Actions)
npm run test:ci
```

### Linting

```bash
# Check for issues
npm run lint

# Fix issues automatically
npm run lint:fix
```

### Docker

```bash
# Build Docker image
npm run docker:build

# Run in Docker container
npm run docker:run
```

